    {
      "name": "button",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "command",
          "level": "baseline",
          "valueSet": "command",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "The action to perform on the element referenced by `commandfor` when the button is activated. Built-in commands are `show-modal`, `close` and `request-close` for `<dialog>` elements, and `show-popover`, `hide-popover` and `toggle-popover` for popovers. Custom commands start with two dashes (for example `--rotate`) and fire a `command` event on the target without any built-in behavior."
          },
          "browsers": [
            "E135",
            "FF144",
            "FFA144",
            "S26.2",
            "SM26.2",
            "C135",
            "CA135",
            "O120"
          ],
          "status": {
            "baseline": "low",
            "baseline_low_date": "2025-12-12"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Specification",
              "url": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#attr-button-command"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "commandfor",
          "level": "baseline",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "The `id` of the element this button controls. Used together with `command` to act on that element, such as opening a dialog or toggling a popover, without JavaScript."
          },
          "browsers": [
            "E135",
            "FF144",
            "FFA144",
            "S26.2",
            "SM26.2",
            "C135",
            "CA135",
            "O120"
          ],
          "status": {
            "baseline": "low",
